# Derived price history — the single largest file (~11 MB), regenerated by
# every bake and published through the Pages artifact, so it is not tracked in
# git. Committing it daily was the source of the local loose-object bloat.
# Untracked on 2026-07-11; a fresh clone must run `node build.js` to produce it
# for local serving. The live site serves the freshly-built copy, not a commit.
docs/data/history.json
